# Stranglethorn Vale (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed
# world containers of Stranglethorn Vale a Horde player can actually engage.
# Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone.
# EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route. Spawn
# points and levels are the local Forever game data (questie-forever); the
# Kurzen Supply Crate is core-linked (it drops the core quest 97047's uniform
# and the core guide already collects it there), so no companion step hunts it.
# No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any
# core-contracted quest, and no tameability flag exists anywhere in the data,
# so no tame lines ship either (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn
# timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. See
# docs/stranglethorn-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this
# guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-horde-rares
title Stranglethorn Vale (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-47
zone Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords stranglethorn, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Mosh'Ogg Butcher — the Ogre Mound

  goto 49.83,30.87
  kill 723 optional
  collect 1680 "Headchopper" optional
  note Level 44 rare (rank 2), flagged rare in the data, at the Mosh'Ogg mound.
  note The Headchopper drops at 7% off the Butcher alone. Maury's Key and Green Hills pages also drop here but feed Alliance-contract quests — not shipped. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Scale Belly — the northeast

  loop
  goto 41.79,48.36
  goto 42.61,46.49
  goto 43.44,45.71
  goto 43.74,47.5
  kill 1552 optional
  collect 1604 "Chromatic Sword" optional
  collect 4478 "Iridescent Scale Leggings" optional
  note Level 45 rare, flagged rare in the data, working the northeast.
  note The Chromatic Sword drops at 25% and the Iridescent Scale Leggings at 75%, both off Scale Belly alone. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lord Sakrasis — the west coast

  loop
  goto 28.33,62.56
  goto 28.85,62.04
  kill 2541 optional
  collect 5028 "Lord Sakrasis' Scepter" optional
  collect 5029 "Talisman of the Naga Lord" optional
  note Level 45 rare, flagged rare in the data, on the west coast.
  note The Scepter and the Talisman drop at 50% each, both off Sakrasis alone. Star Belt also drops here at 0.12% but is a 25-dropper generic, not a signature — not shipped. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Gluggle — the northwest

  loop
  goto 33.92,22.63
  goto 34.71,21.9
  goto 34.87,22.71
  goto 35.52,23.73
  kill 14487 optional
  collect 281750 "Murloc Oracle's Dagger" optional
  note Level 37 rare, flagged rare in the data, in the northwest.
  note The Murloc Oracle's Dagger drops off Gluggle alone (no rate in the data). Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Roloch — the north

  goto 37.37,31.22
  kill 14488 optional
  note Level 38 rare, flagged rare in the data, in the north.
  note The data records no signature loot on this rare — generics only, kill note, no collect. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

